// drowned-lair — brinstar depths in F♯ minor, 76 BPM. Generated by MathMusic
// (style brinstar, seed 3): spore haze → the roots → brinstar depths → the hunt → the lair → dripping.
// Themes: A — Deep Moss (глубокий мох) (ornamented), B — Lair Below (логово внизу) (recomposed); the bridge melody is newly
// composed on the rhythm of a theme from classical. Computed parts: a counter-melody from the chords, a run up to the dominant in every build-up, the theme at half speed in the outro.
// It is an ordinary song file: change anything; the melodies can be drawn in the piano roll (P).
// x is time in beats; n counts semitones from C4 (MIDI 60).
